# UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer suppressions for RAMULATOR2_SANITIZE=1 builds.
#
# Only known, pre-existing issues in vendored code belong here. Never add
# ChampSim integration code or native Ramulator 2 sources.
#
# Vendored ITTAGE's MYRANDOM() left-shifts a negative int
# (inc/ittage/ittage.hpp:246 and :248). GCC produces the two's-complement
# result; recorded ittage_64kb results depend on it, so the vendored code is
# left unchanged (see CLAUDE.md).
shift-base:*/inc/ittage/ittage.hpp
